                       app-screen scenes (not a repeat of the left-column copy), chosen
                       by what the step is actually about: a dashboard/report check-in,
                       a completed/settled confirmation, or a live notification. -->
                  <div class="fd-workflow__phone-stage">
                    {% for item in feature.workflow %}
                    {% set lowerBody = item.body | lower %}
